# Marauding Sphinx has flying and vigilance: it attacks turn 3 and Bot2's Memnite (no flying or reach) cannot block it (CR 702.9b), so Bot2
# takes 3, and the Sphinx is not tapped by attacking (CR 702.20b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Marauding Sphinx
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Marauding Sphinx.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Marauding Sphinx > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Memnite > Marauding Sphinx)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Battlefield.Marauding Sphinx.Tapped = false
